  "body": {
    "state": {
      "reviews": {
        "r0": "You can't even listen to music you want it just shuffles it, like what the hell? This app is killing it self and forcing you to pay premium for basic things like just listening to music.",
        "r1": "This was fine till the last update, now you can't even pick a certain song without Spotify premium, and now you can only skip 6 songs, like please just let the songs fit my mood!",
        "r2": "Why it requires premium just to play next music / to choose music ?? And why the specific part of song cannot be played ?",
        "r3": "Worst app.",
        "r4": "You deserve 0 star",
        "r5": "Spotify is great, but the new homescreen update is horrible. You're not tiktok or Instagram. I don't want to scroll through 1 playlist or album or artist at a time.",
        "r6": "Please stop with the recommendations! I use the premium family sub and I want to listen to my playlist without your recommendation adds. I am not interested in new music based on my preferences. If I wanted these songs I'd use a random playlist not not make my own! I'll start using Amazon music or apple if you don't.",
        "r7": "The update made the app useless .... Uninstall krdia ye app ab bekar hai ... Wynk hi theek h",
        "r8": "Recent update really sucks. The ability to skip a song or go to previous song has been removed from non subscribed users.",
        "r9": "Iam a premium user. But this app if i using wifi not able to connect Internet. But if using mobile data it will work. Some songs quality also very poor comparing to the YouTube music.",
        "r10": "Used to love the app but recent update is very disappointing bye Spotify",
        "r11": "There is some bugs like music adjustment doesn't work Perporly plz do something about this bug",
        "r12": "The latest update has caused my app to crash I cant open the app please fix.",
        "r13": "I would request to remove all the new features .what's the point if we dont get to go back to the same song or skip songs..or choose .its not fair ..to restrict all the features jst so people would purchase premium ..its like forcing ..to do it ..and day by day it's getting more annoying..I g I'll switch to some other apps .if it remains like this forever.!",
        "r14": "Soo trash wayy to many ads I don't want premium but too much ads",
        "r15": "This app the new update has made everthing premium and so usless i thought this app is good but no. Youtube music is better than this usless app. This has become premium just for the creator of spotify to earn money anyways it is a very bad app usless since this new update! Worthless app",
        "r16": "I am using Spotify from past two years From last update they removed basic features of music player",
        "r17": "I like the app, but I don't like that it is always stuck downloading songs in the background and gets stuck until I open Spotify. Idk if it's clever marketing to get the user to open the app, or if it's a bug...either way it is very annoying and has forced me to consider canceling my premium after years of being a subscriber to Hulu/Spotify. I'm sure no one reads these reviews after reading a few of the others. Shame on you spotify",
        "r18": "RUDE APP , THIS APP SUPPORT GUYS 🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮. تطبيق سيء ، بدعم المثليين 🤮🤮🤮",
        "r19": "Disappointing",
        "r20": "Your new features are really bad thing that I found because it plays any song of the Playlist randomly it really really disappointing for and listeners who don't need disturbance in their song patterns. I apologise to your team for reverse your updated or change the new features to old features . Thanks 😊",
        "r21": "Aakhir kar spotify ne bhi apni bhikaariyo vali aukaat dikha di \"Gadar karbe\" Chanda mangna got real Bhikaariyo ko training dena bhi shuru kardo haramiyo",
        "r22": "Recent update 👎",
        "r23": "I m using this app from 5 to 6 year but now m uninstald this app cz his premium adds are everywhere now .",
        "r24": "Vary bad experience.i am uninstalling this app they burn quran and i will bycot this app as it is launched by swedan 🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕🖕",
        "r25": "Offline not workjng",
        "r26": "I am unable to use my Google assistant on the app.it says playing your Spotify playlist but do not play the songs",
        "r27": "Very bad app",
        "r28": "This app is nice but adds are too much",
        "r29": "Doesn't deserve even one star. Like what's the problem? We can't even go back few second to play music? WHAT IN THE WORLD IS THIS UPDATE? YOU PEOPLE NEED MORE MONEY?! gonna delete the app if they don't fix this",
        "r30": "Nice app! But many songs are not present here!",
        "r31": "What kind of stupidity is this? Na queue m lgte h gaane, na skip kr skte h, na random chla skte h, kya bkchodi h ye??? Jaruri h premium lena? Nhi lena bhai thodi to sharam kro saare paise tumhi kma loge kya💀💀 alag hi pagapan h",
        "r32": "Too much restrictions",
        "r33": "The ads are so loud :'(",
        "r34": "DON'T DOWNLOAD THIS:Such a worst app ... that always plays adds instead of songs ...if want to enjoy music free without adds don't download this app ..",
        "r35": "Keep stopping halfway while playing music and it dun go back to where they stop and start playing a new song for you.",
        "r36": "Will not except my password",
        "r37": "Worst app",
        "r38": "I just want to listen to one song but nooo I have to go through A HOLE PLAYLIST AND I CAN ONLY SKIP 6 OF THEM 6!!!",
        "r39": "I really have enjoyed the blend feature you've released. I can't wait to see it expanded upon. Like being able to rename the blends you make would be nice. The same issue as 5 years ago when I left a review still persists. Spotify constantly rolls out new major UX updates without any use of their beta program. Rolling out big automatically playing audio elements,without any clear way to disable the automatic playing in the settings? Seriously? That kind of stuff should be opt-in...",
        "r40": "Am very sad about the new spotfy update. i can't play song happly . Can't repeat and play specific part.please solve this matter. I'm leaving spotfy",
        "r41": "Noob app",
        "r42": "sometime the lyrics don't show",
        "r43": "App is stuck on loading/logo screen",
        "r44": "It not letting me into my account and there are to many ads",
        "r45": "It is good but there is a problem that in some songs there is no lyrics and in some songs there is lyrics it's so confusing. However it is good 😊😊.",
        "r46": "It's nice but gospel music isn't much",
        "r47": "It was a good app . But now it's a trash 🗑️",
        "r48": "Too many ads.... it's literally useless if u hv not taken premium"
